1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:04,000
(Leonard:)Hear, hear.
Cheers.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,830
(Howard:)You realize that's the first
time we've ever done that

3
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:07,650
(Howard:)without having
to listen to Sheldon tell us

4
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:09,440
(Howard:)why it's called a toast?

5
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,640
(Priya:)Why is it
called a toast?

6
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,910
(Leonard:)Oh, the ancient Romans

7
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:15,010
(Leonard:)put spiced toast
in their punch bowls.

8
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:20,150
(Raj:)Sheldon tells it better.

9
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:21,880
(Leonard:)He kind of does.

10
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,120
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

11
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:27,790
(Leonard:)Aw, hell, I miss him.

12
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:32,690
(Penny:)So, where do you guys
want to go dancing?

13
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,460
(Bernadette:)We were hoping
you'd know a place.

14
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:36,830
(Amy:)Yes, perhaps somewhere
packed tightly

15
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,130
(Amy:)with young, beautiful bodies

16
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:39,800
(Amy:)sweating and writhing
against each other

17
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,400
(Amy:)in a glorious orgy
of the flesh.

18
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:44,470
(Penny:)Oh, yeah, I know that place.

19
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,410
(Penny:)What do you think?

20
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:49,040
(Amy:)That should display enough
of your bosom

21
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:52,110
(Amy:)to attract a new mate,
or a hungry infant.

22
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:55,380
(Penny:)Okay, let's go
through this one more time.

23
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:57,120
(Penny:)Just because
Leonard has a new girlfriend

24
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:59,670
(Penny:)does not mean I need to go out
and hook up with some guy.

